   "subject": "Re: overlay two step plots",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\">By adding a grouping, then cumsum&#39;ing within that group then plotting it does the same thing without the need for tidyr:</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\">rainfall &lt;- data.frame(dates = c(as.Date(&quot;2014-03-01&quot;)+0:6,as.Date(&quot;2015-03-01&quot;)+0:6), rain = runif(14,0,4))</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\">rainfall %&gt;% </font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>mutate(day = day(dates), year = year(dates)) %&gt;% </font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>select(day, year, rain) %&gt;% </font></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>group_by(year) %&gt;%</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>mutate(cumsumrain = cumsum(rain)) %&gt;%<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>ggplot(data=., aes(x=day, y=cumsumrain, colour=as.factor(year))) + </font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>geom_step()</font></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">Thanks for the reproducible example! </div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">B</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, Apr 1, 2016 at 9:08 AM, ArjunaCap <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mcaw...@greenstenergy.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">rainfall </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">frame</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">dates </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">as</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Date</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;2014-03-01&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">6</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">as</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Date</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;2015-03-01&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">6</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> rain </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> runif</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">14</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">4</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">))</span></blockquote></div><br><br></div></div>"
